sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent /<br/>bootstrap
  participant S as Forwarder
  participant C as EgressAuthorizer<br/>OCC
  participant R as Resolver
  Note over A,R: Proposed flow, calls/returns do not imply implementation
  A->>S: Authenticated operation
  S->>S: capture seals operation<br/>forward owns subsequent steps
  S->>C: check(before_access)<br/>Caller, operation, versioned route and grant
  C-->>S: Allow, deny or unavailable
  break Denied or authority unavailable
    Note over A,C: Refuse before material access
    S-->>A: Refuse before material access
  end
  opt Allowed credentialed operation
    S->>R: resolve with AccessPermit
    R-->>S: Use-bound handle + evidence or typed refusal
    Note over S,R: Static: admitted live or approved version / snapshot<br/>Cache binds mode, target store, reference and version<br/>Snapshot reads need no latest provenance value, no implicit opt-in
    Note over S,R: Cold / expired dynamic material: not_ready<br/>No issuance, signing, refresh or scheduling<br/>No dynamic proxy cache or fallback
    break denied, not_ready or unavailable
      Note over A,C: Refuse before send
      S-->>A: Refuse before send
    end
  end
  Note over S,C: Credential-free egress skips resolution,<br/>not authorization
  S->>S: Verify unchanged captured operation<br/>MaterialHandle + evidence or none
  Note over S,C: Continue to final check<br/>A handle is not send authority
  Note over A,R: Management preparation has separate authorization<br/>Agent flags and bootstrap delegation cannot select it
